body:
Hi, you'll need to set the root level of your hierarchical attribute in [`attributesToHighlight`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/api-parameters/attributesToHighlight/?client=javascript) in order to retrieve highlights for sub levels, for example:

```jsx
<InstantSearch>
  <Configure attributesToHighlight={['metadata']} /> {/* This can also be done in the Dashboard */}
  <Hits hitComponent={HitComponent} />
</InstantSearch>

// ...

function HitComponent({ hit }) {
  return <div>
    <Highlight attribute="metadata.publisher" hit={hit} />
  </div>;
}
```
